  <data name="Changelog.AccentColor.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>New accent color</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.AccentColor.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Logo, active menu items, sorting and buttons now appear in gold instead of turquoise and match the labels.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.Discover.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>All Animes is now called Discover</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.Discover.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The page with all animes has a new name that suits browsing with filters and sorting better.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.CardDesign.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>New card design</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.CardDesign.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The cards now show cover, countdown to the next episode, rating, description and genres in landscape format. A click on the image opens all details. The top 10 now sit two side by side.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.ExtendedFilters.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Extended filters</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.ExtendedFilters.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Besides the streaming service you can now also filter by genres such as Action, Comedy or Romance. Both filters allow ticking several entries at once.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.FullSimulcast.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Complete simulcast</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.FullSimulcast.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The simulcast now shows all animes that are currently airing or about to start, including sequels from earlier seasons.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.FilterSort.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Filtering and sorting</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.FilterSort.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The tables now offer filtering and sorting.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.MoreInfo.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>More information about every anime</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.MoreInfo.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>In Simulcast and Top 10 the info icon at the top right of the image opens all details about an anime, in All Animes a click on the row does. The information is only loaded when you open it.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.TopTenPopularity.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Popularity in the top 10</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.TopTenPopularity.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The top 10 now also show how popular an anime is. For finished animes, the number of episodes is shown instead of the next episode.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.NewHome.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>New home page</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.NewHome.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Here you first see the news and below it the ten most popular animes.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.NewAllAnimes.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>New page All Animes</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.NewAllAnimes.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>On this page you can now find all animes in a table, including their number of episodes.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.SimulcastCount.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Simulcast with total count</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.SimulcastCount.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The simulcast page now shows how many animes are airing in the current season.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.MorePadding.Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>More space on all pages</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Changelog.MorePadding.Description" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The pages now use the full width of your screen.</value>
  </data>
